      "source": "Instructions for how to upgrade from earlier versions of Spring Data are provided on the project <a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-commons/wiki\">wiki</a>.\nFollow the links in the <a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-commons/wiki#release-notes\">release notes section</a> to find the version that you want to upgrade to.",
      "translation": "有关如何从早期版本的 Spring Data 升级的说明，请参阅项目 <a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-commons/wiki\">wiki</a>。请按照 <a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-commons/wiki#release-notes\">发布说明部分</a> 中的链接，找到您想要升级到的版本。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Upgrading instructions are always the first item in the release notes. If you are more than one release behind, please make sure that you also review the release notes of the versions that you jumped.",
      "translation": "升级说明始终位于发布说明的首项。如果您落后于当前版本超过一个，请务必同时查阅您跳过的各个版本的发布说明。",
      "count": 1
    },
